## Decision rule (MVP default strategy)
- **ask (continue)** when entropy > 0.6 OR no cluster has relevance ≥ 0.3
- **recommend** when at least one cluster has relevance ≥ 0.3 AND entropy ≤ 0.6
Use your judgement for borderline cases; prefer **ask** when in doubt.

## Available actions

- **recommend** — The oracle's preferences are clear enough to present a
  cluster recommendation.
- **continue** — More information is needed before a useful recommendation can
  be made.

## Cognitive-load constraints
- Present at most 5 titles per cluster.
- Present at most 6 clusters per turn.

